erything else is 'expired'. Stripe is the source of truth for paid status, Firestore createdAt for trial window."}, {"id": "admin_getdate", "label": "getDate", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:908", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tolerates three createdAt encodings (Firestore Timestamp with toDate, raw {seconds} object, ISO string) because merchants were created by different code paths over time."}, {"id": "admin_formatcurrency", "label": "formatCurrency", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:916", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "admin_formatdate", "label": "formatDate", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:920", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "admin_renderplanbreakdown", "label": "renderPlanBreakdown", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:927", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "admin_renderregchart", "label": "renderRegChart", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:958", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "admin_rendertable", "label": "renderTable", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:1002", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "admin_escapehtml", "label": "escapeHtml", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:1090", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "admin_capitalize", "label": "capitalize", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:1096", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "admin_super_admin_gate", "label": "Super Admin email gate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:781-827", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Admin panel authorisation is a single hard-coded email (ADMIN_EMAIL) compared client-side after Firebase email/password sign-in and again in onAuthStateChanged; any other user is signed out. No custom claims or Firestore role: it relies on Firestore rules to actually protect the 'merchants' collection read. Fragile: the gate is purely cosmetic if rules allow reads."}, {"id": "admin_mrr_kpi", "label": "MRR / SaaS KPI computation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:848-892", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "MRR = sum of PLAN_PRICES[plan] over merchants with status 'active' only; trials and expired contribute nothing. Plan defaults to 'starter' when missing. KPIs computed client-side from a full scan of the 'merchants' collection (acceptable at current scale, will not scale past a few thousand merchants)."}], "edges": [{"source": "admin_loadmerchants", "target": "admin_processdata", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:839", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "admin_processdata", "target": "admin_getmerchantstatus", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:859", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "admin_processdata", "target": "admin_formatcurrency", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "admin.html", "source_location": "admin.html:878", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "admin_processdata", "target": "admin_renderplanbreakdown", "relat